INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(4961,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5753190','The IUPHAR/BPS Guide to PHARMACOLOGY in 2018: updates and expansion to encompass the new guide to IMMUNOPHARMACOLOGY.','Harding SD, Sharman JL, Faccenda E, Southan C, Pawson AJ, Ireland S, Gray AJG, Bruce L, Alexander SPH, Anderton S, Bryant C, Davenport AP, Doerig C, Fabbro D, Levi-Schaffer F, Spedding M, Davies JA; NC-IUPHAR.','2018','subcommittees curators guidetoimmunopharmacology forked immunopharmacological druggable subcommittees iuis immunologists chemoinformatic immport immport immgen immgen innatedb innatedb reactome reactome imgt imgt immunologist overriding stringency amalgamation fixing pointers stereoisomers cheminformatic usan uniprotkb swissprot rig familydisplayforward familyid familydisplayforward familyid familydisplayforward familyid guidetoimmunopharmacology familydisplayforward familyid familydisplayforward familyid familydisplayforward familyid butyrophilin butyrophilin piezo subfamilies immunologists uniprotkb 7tm organics inorganics inns sids 7tm uniprotkb uniprotkb accessions mmoa subfamilies toggle familydisplayforward familyid hgnc genenames genefamilies ligandfamiliesforward sids sourcename mappings neighbours sids slicing dicing complementarity drugcentral bypassing fasta pasted comma visualising findability summarising palosuran hovering datapoint palosuran normalising subcommittees orcids contributorlistforward subcommittees tagging immuneregulationnews immune_news humanimmunologynews britsocimm tagging citeulike browsed citeulike immpharm citeulike efaccenda curatorial guidetoimmunopharmacology immunofurtherreadingforward citeulike cdsouthan queue citeulike cdsouthan tobecurated curatorial subsumed geneontology obofoundry curators monoclonals guidetoimmunopharmacology immunohelppage curators immunologists uniprotkb uniprotkb purl obolibrary obo obo populate is_a uniprotkb 2017_08 parsed geneontology curators tenuous iea curatorial curators uniprotkb ma