. 1999. “Influence of Periodontal Infections on Systemic Health.” Periodontology 2000 21, no. 1: 197–209. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Moreira‐Souza, L. , Butini Oliveira L., Gaêta‐Araujo H., Almeida‐Marques M., Asprino L., and Oenning A. C.. 2022. “Comparison of CBCT and Panoramic Radiography for the Assessment of Bone Loss and Root Resorption on the Second Molar Associated With Third Molar Impaction: A Systematic Review.” Dentomaxillofacial Radiology 51, no. 3: 20210217. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Page, R. C. 1998. “The Pathobiology of Periodontal Diseases May Affect Systemic Diseases: Inversion of a Paradigm.” Annals of Periodontology 3, no. 1: 108–120. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Razi, T. , Moslemzade S. H., and Razi S.. 2009. “Comparison of Linear Dimensions and Angular Measurements on Panoramic Images Taken With Two Machines.” Journal of Dental Research, Dental Clinics, Dental Prospects 3, no. 1: 7–10. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Ruetters, M. , Gehrig H., Kim T.‐S., et al. 2022. “Imaging Furcation Defects With Low‐Dose Cone Beam Computed Tomography.” Scientific Reports 12, no. 1: 6824. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Ruetters, M. , Gehrig H., Kronsteiner D., et al. 2022. “Low‐Dose Cbct Imaging of Alveolar Buccal Bone Adjacent to Mandibular Anterior Teeth—A Pilot Study.” Clinical Oral Investigations 26, no. 5: 4173–4182. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Sangha, K. S. , Khetrapal P., Gupta S., Singh A., Kumar J., and Billaiya P.. 2021. “Assessment of the Accuracy of Panoramic Radiography (PR), Cone Beam Computed Tomography (CBCT) and Clinical Methods in Measuring Alveolar Bone Dimension: A Comparative Study.” Annals of the Romanian Society for Cell Biology 25, no. 4: 12134–12141. [ Google Scholar ] Scarfe, W. C. , and Farman A. G.. 2008. “What Is Cone‐Beam CT and How Does It Work?” Dental Clinics of North America 52, no. 4: 707–7